There are several `@@@` comments in your code, so the output contains several assertions. Each assertion corresponds to one of the comments:
 - The first comment indicates that if the array contained x before the operation, the first index of x decreases or remains same the operation.
 - The second and third comments are assertions to check that the state of the "private" fields (`_items`, `_size` and `_version`) stay the same after the insertion is made. 
 - The fourth comment is an assertion against the contents of the list before and after an item is removed from it.--------------------
